#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "Zinn® Cache"
msgstr "Zinn® Cache"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache"

#. Description of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works."
msgstr "Kaydka bogagga iyo kaydka shayga Redis ee kasta oo WordPress ah. Waxay isticmaashaa kaydka server-ka LiteSpeed halka uu jiro iyo kaydka disk-ka ee iyada u gaar ah meel kasta oo kale, waxay nadiifisaa kaliya waxa isbeddelku saameeyo, waxayna caddaynaysaa in xiriirkeeda Redis uu shaqeynayo."

#. Author of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"
msgstr "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com"

#: includes/class-admin.php:104
msgid "Cache"
msgstr "Kaydka"

#: includes/class-admin.php:110
#: includes/class-admin.php:153
msgid "Page cache"
msgstr "Bogga kaydka meelgaarka ah"

#: includes/class-admin.php:114
#: includes/class-admin.php:238
msgid "Object cache"
msgstr "Kaydka shayga"

#: includes/class-admin.php:118
msgid "Purging"
msgstr "Tiroobista"

#: includes/class-admin.php:122
msgid "Exclusions"
msgstr "Ka reeban"

#: includes/class-admin.php:129
msgid "Purge everything now"
msgstr "Nadiifi wax kasta hadda"

#: includes/class-admin.php:130
msgid "Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?"
msgstr "Bog kasta oo keydsan (cached) waa la tirtiray waxaana dib loo dhisi doonaa marka ay soo booqdayaashu yimaadaan. Ma rabtaa inaad sii waddo?"

#: includes/class-admin.php:147
msgid "Full-page cache"
msgstr "Kaydka bogga buuxa"

#: includes/class-admin.php:148
msgid "On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from."
msgstr "Server-ka LiteSpeed, bogisyada waxaa adeega shabakadda server-ka ka hor inta uusan WordPress shaqayn. Server kasta oo kale, sabuutaddan (plugin) waxay keydis personalidad kasta oo bog ah oo waxay u adeegtaa ka hor inta uusan WordPress soo bixin. Halkaan ayaa laga helaa ku dhawaad ​​dhammaan xawaaraha."

#: includes/class-admin.php:154
msgid "Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in"
msgstr "Kaydi bogosyada booqdayayaasha aan soo gelin"

#: includes/class-admin.php:160
msgid "How long a page stays cached"
msgstr "Inta uu boggu kaydsan yahay"

#: includes/class-admin.php:161
msgid "Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less."
msgstr "Ilbidhiqsi. Todobaad ayaa ku habboon inta badan mareegaha; bogga wararka ee daabaca saacad kasta wuxuu rabaa wax aad uga yar."

#: includes/class-admin.php:170
msgid "How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts"
msgstr "Inta ay le'eg tahay inta uu biraawsarka booqashadu hayo sawirrada iyo qoraallada kombuyuutarka"

#: includes/class-admin.php:171
msgid "Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyo. Waxay khusaysaa kaliya sawirrada, CSS-ka iyo JavaScript-ka — weligeed ma khusayso bogagga. U deji 0 si aad tan ugu dayfto martigeliyahaaga."

#: includes/class-admin.php:179
msgid "Signed-in visitors"
msgstr "Booqdayeyaasha soo galay"

#: includes/class-admin.php:180
msgid "Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor"
msgstr "Weligea ha u adeegin bogag kaydsan booqde soo galay"

#: includes/class-admin.php:181
msgid "On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to."
msgstr "Daaridu waa jawaabta badbaadada leh waana tan caadiga ah. Demi kaliya haddii aad ogtahay in bog kasta oo la kaydiyay uu u siman yahay isticmaale kasta oo soo galay — bogga xubinnimada ayaa ah sababta caadiga ah ee aan loo damin."

#: includes/class-admin.php:187
msgid "Different lifetimes for different content"
msgstr "Nolosho kala duwan ee xogta kala duwan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:188
msgid "For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week."
msgstr "Tusaale ahaan: bogagga badeecada ee dukaanka muddo saacad ah, iyadoo wax kasta oo kale ay sii jiraan hal toddobaad."

#: includes/class-admin.php:189
msgid "Add a rule"
msgstr "Ku dar sharci"

#: includes/class-admin.php:196
msgid "Content type"
msgstr "Nooca nuxurka"

#: includes/class-admin.php:202
msgid "Seconds"
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyo"

#: includes/class-admin.php:223
#: includes/class-admin.php:232
msgid "Object cache (Redis)"
msgstr "Kaydka walxaha (Redis)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:224
msgid "Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working."
msgstr "Host-kaagu waxa uu boggan u wadaa keyd shay Redis ah oo gaar ah oona wuu sii habeeyey. Halkaan wax lagu habeeyo ma jiraan; heerka ku yaal dusha shaashaddan waxa uu tusayaa in uu shaqeynayo iyo in kale."

#: includes/class-admin.php:233
msgid "Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot."
msgstr "Wuxuu kaydiyaa natiijooyinka su'aalaha database-ka. Waxay siweyn uga caawisaa dukaanka mashquulka badan ama bogga leh taraafiko badan oo soo galay, halkaas oo kaydka boggu (page cache) awoodin inuu sameeyo."

#: includes/class-admin.php:239
msgid "Install the Redis object-cache drop-in"
msgstr "Ku rakib Redis object-cache drop-in"

#: includes/class-admin.php:240
msgid "Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so."
msgstr "Waxay u baahan tahay kordhinta phpredis. Haddii ay ka maqan tahay, sanduuqa ka sarreeya shaashaddan ayaa sidaas sheegaya."

#: includes/class-admin.php:246
msgid "Redis host"
msgstr "Martida Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:253
msgid "Redis port"
msgstr "Boortiga Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:262
msgid "Redis database"
msgstr "Xogtaanka Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:263
msgid "Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache."
msgstr "Go site kasta oo ku yaalla Redis wadareed lambarkiisa gaarka ah, ama midba midka kale ka tirtiri doono kaydkiisa (cache)."

#: includes/class-admin.php:272
msgid "Redis username"
msgstr "Magaca isticmaalaha Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:273
msgid "Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone."
msgstr "Kaliya server-ka Redis ee leh isticmaaleyaasha ACL (Redis 6 ama wixii ka dambeeya). Iskadaa bannaan si aad ugu gasho erayga sirta ah oo keliya."

#: includes/class-admin.php:281
msgid "Redis password"
msgstr "Erayga sirta ah ee Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:282
msgid "Leave blank if your Redis does not need one."
msgstr "Haddii Redis uusan u baahnayn, meesha ka bannee."

#: includes/class-admin.php:289
msgid "Key prefix"
msgstr "Furaha hordhaca"

#: includes/class-admin.php:290
msgid "An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one."
msgstr "Beddelka lambarka database-ka ee gooni ah marka aadan yeelan karin."

#: includes/class-admin.php:307
msgid "Smart auto-purge"
msgstr "Nadiifin caqli badan oo toos ah"

#: includes/class-admin.php:308
msgid "Clear affected pages automatically when content changes"
msgstr "Si toos ah u nadiifi bogagga ay dhibaatadu saameysey marka nuxurku isbeddelo"

#: includes/class-admin.php:314
msgid "After updates"
msgstr "Ka dib cusboonaysiinta"

#: includes/class-admin.php:315
msgid "Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update"
msgstr "Tirtir wax kasta oo ka dambeeya cusboonaysiinta asaasiga ah, qalabka ama mawduuca"

#: includes/class-admin.php:321
msgid "After a comment"
msgstr "Ka dib faallo"

#: includes/class-admin.php:322
msgid "Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved"
msgstr "Nadiifi bogga qoraalka marka faallo ku taal la oggolaado"

#: includes/class-admin.php:323
msgid "Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour."
msgstr "Dami tan qayb faallooyin ah oo aad u mashquul badan, halkaas oo ay ku nadiifin karto boggaas oo kale boqolaal jeer saacaddii."

#: includes/class-admin.php:338
msgid "Never cache these"
msgstr "Weligi ha kaydin kuwani"

#: includes/class-admin.php:339
msgid "Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below."
msgstr "Heerarka caadiga ah ee macquulka ah ee WordPress iyo WooCommerce ayaa had iyo jeer la adeegsadaa — gaariga iibsashada, bixinta lacagta, akoonkayga iyo kalfadhi kasta oo la galay weligood lama kaydiyo, wax kasta oo hooseeya."

#: includes/class-admin.php:345
msgid "Addresses"
msgstr "Ciwaannada IP-ga"

#: includes/class-admin.php:346
msgid "One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it."
msgstr "Hal dariiq ah sadarkiiiba, tusaale ahaan <code>/basket</code>. <code>*</code> dhammaadka ku taal waxay waafaqaysaa wax kasta oo hoos yaalla."

#: includes/class-admin.php:354
msgid "Query parameters"
msgstr "Cabashooyinka weydiinta"

#: includes/class-admin.php:355
msgid "A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token."
msgstr "Bog ay ku jirto mid ka mid ah kuwan lagama kaydiyo — tusaale ahaan calaamada horu-eegista ee hal mar la isticmaalo."

#: includes/class-admin.php:363
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Buskud"

#: includes/class-admin.php:364
msgid "A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page."
msgstr "Booqde sidan wata waxaa mar walba loo adeegaa bog cusub."

#: includes/class-admin.php:393
msgid "Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive."
msgstr "Bog kasta oo kaydsan waa la tirtiray. Waxaa dib loo dhisi doonaa marka ay soo booqdayaal yimaadaan."

#: includes/class-admin.php:419
msgid "The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything."
msgstr "Kaydka shayga waa la rakibay, laakiin wax xog ah ma kaydinayo."

#: includes/class-admin.php:433
msgid "The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet."
msgstr "Kaydka bogaggu wuu shaqeeyaa, laakiin bogaggu weli lama kaydinayo."

#: includes/class-admin.php:434
msgid "WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php."
msgstr "WordPress weli ma aanu shuban kaydka bogga ee hoos u dhaca (page-cache drop-in). Waxay ka bilaabmaysaa xamuulka bogga xiga; haddii aysan sameyn, hubi in WP_CACHE ay tahay run (true) gudaha wp-config.php."

#: includes/class-admin.php:443
msgid "The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support."
msgstr "Kaydka shaygu waa daaran yahay, laakiin adeegetani ma taageerto Redis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:444
msgid "The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis."
msgstr "Kordhiyaha phpredis lama rakibin, markaa lama isticmaali karo qalabka loo yaqaan drop-in, WordPress-na waxay ku noqonaysaa kaydkeeda xusuusta dhexdeeda ah. Weydii shirkaddaada martigelinta inay awood u yeelato phpredis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:452
msgid "Nothing is being cached."
msgstr "Wax khasnad ah lama keydinayo."

#: includes/class-admin.php:453
msgid "Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster."
msgstr "Labada kayd (cache) waa la damiyay, markaa furahaani (plugin) ma keenayo in boggu si dhakhso ah u shaqeeyo."

#: includes/class-admin.php:460
msgid "Caching is active on this site."
msgstr "Kaydinta ayaa ka shaqeyneysa boggan."

#: includes/class-admin.php:495
msgid "Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen."
msgstr "Redis wuxuu diiday magaca isticmaalaha ama erayga sirta ah. Hubi aqoonsiga Redis ee ku jira wp-config.php ama shaashaddan."

#: includes/class-admin.php:497
msgid "Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site's key prefix."
msgstr "Redis wuu aqbalay gelitaanka laakiin uma oggolaanayo boggan inuu kaydiyo fureyaasheeda. Isticmaalaha Redis wuxuu u baahan yahay ogolaansho hordhaca furaha boggan."

#: includes/class-admin.php:499
msgid "Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting."
msgstr "Redis wuu diiday nambarka xog-ururinta. Hubi dejinta xog-ururinta Redis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:501
msgid "Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data."
msgstr "Redis xusuusta ayay ka dhammaatay waxayna diidmaysaa xogta cusub."

#: includes/class-admin.php:503
msgid "The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis."
msgstr "Kordhiyaha phpredis lama rakibin, markaa WordPress waxay isticmaashaa kaydkeeda xusuusta dhexdeeda ah. Weydii martigeliyahaaga inuu sahqo phpredis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:505
msgid "WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off."
msgstr "WP_REDIS_DISABLED waxaa lagu dejiyay wp-config.php, markaa kaydka shayga waa la damiyay."

#: includes/class-admin.php:507
msgid "The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running."
msgstr "Lama gaari karo server-ka Redis. Hubi host-ka iyo dekedda Redis, iyo in Redis uu shaqaynayo."

#: includes/class-admin.php:509
msgid "Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server's logs."
msgstr "Redis ma soo celinin qiimihii hadda lagu qoray. Ka eeg diiwaannada server-ka Redis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:524
msgid "Web server"
msgstr "Web server"

#: includes/class-admin.php:526
msgid "LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server"
msgstr "LiteSpeed — boggagu waxaa kaydiya server-ka mareegta"

#: includes/class-admin.php:527
msgid "not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin"
msgstr "LiteSpeed ​​ma aha — boggag waxaa ku kaydiya saxan plugin-kan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:530
msgid "Pages stored on disk"
msgstr "Bogagga ku kaydsan saxanka"

#: includes/class-admin.php:534
msgid "Redis support"
msgstr "Taageerada Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:536
msgid "phpredis is installed"
msgstr "phpredis waa la rakibay"

#: includes/class-admin.php:537
msgid "phpredis is not installed"
msgstr "phpredis lama rakibin"

#: includes/class-admin.php:540
msgid "Page lifetime"
msgstr "Muddada nolosha bogga"

#: includes/class-admin.php:615
msgid "You are not allowed to purge the cache."
msgstr "Uma oggola inaad nadiifiso kaydka."

#: includes/class-admin.php:621
msgid "Cache purge requested."
msgstr "Nadiifinta kaydka ayaa la codsaday."

#: includes/class-admin.php:649
msgid "Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin."
msgstr "Zinn® Cache: shayga kaydinta shayga kale waa la rakibay, markaa Redis kaydinta shayga looma maamulo plugin-kan."

#: includes/class-admin.php:663
msgid "detected"
msgstr "la ogaaday"

#: includes/class-admin.php:664
msgid "not detected"
msgstr "lama ogaan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:668
msgid "phpredis extension missing"
msgstr "eextenshanka phpredis ayaa maqan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:670
msgid "installed, not storing anything"
msgstr "la rakibay, waxba ma kaydinayo"

#: includes/class-admin.php:672
msgid "active, managed by your host"
msgstr "shaqaynaya, waxa maamula martigeliyahaaga"

#: includes/class-admin.php:674
msgid "active"
msgstr "firfircoon"

#: includes/class-admin.php:676
msgid "inactive"
msgstr "aan firfircoonayn"

#: includes/class-admin.php:681
msgid "LiteSpeed cache:"
msgstr "Kaydka LiteSpeed:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:683
msgid "Redis object cache:"
msgstr "Kaydka walxaha Redis:"

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:256
msgid "The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled."
msgstr "Eextenshanka Redis PHP (phpredis) kuma jiro server-kan, sidaas darteed kaydka walxaha lama shidi karo."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:263
msgid "Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache."
msgstr "Drop-in-ka object-cache kale ayaa horay loo sii rakibay. Ka saar kahor intaadan awood-siin Zinn® object cache."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:275
msgid "Could not write the Redis connection configuration file."
msgstr "Faylka habaynta xiriirka Redis lama qori karin."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:283
msgid "The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read."
msgstr "Drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha ee la keydiyay lama akhrin karin."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:290
msgid "Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content."
msgstr "Drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha laguma rakibi karin wp-content."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:316
msgid "Could not remove the object-cache drop-in."
msgstr "Drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha lama saari karin."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:411
msgid "The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed."
msgstr "Nidaamka faylalka WordPress lama qori karo, sidaas darteed drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha lama maareyn karin."

#: includes/class-page-cache.php:291
msgid "Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache."
msgstr "Qalab kale oo kaydinta bogagga (page-cache) ayaa rakibay wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Ka saar qalabkaas marka hore, ama sii wad isticmaalka kaydkiisa bogga."

#: includes/class-page-cache.php:294
msgid "The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached."
msgstr "Galka wp-content/cache/zinn-cache lama qori karo, markaas lama kaydin karo bogagga."

#: includes/class-page-cache.php:301
msgid "wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached."
msgstr "wp-content/advanced-cache.php lama qori karo, markaa bogagga lama kaydin karo."

#: includes/class-updater.php:250
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "Fiiri qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-updater.php:299
msgid "The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again."
msgstr "Adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® ayaan soo saarin xiriiriye soo dejineed oo loogu talagalay cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in boggani uu gaari karo madal-weyneha Zinn®, kadibna isku day mar labaad."

#. translators: %s: the download error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-updater.php:313
#, php-format
msgid "The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "Cusboonaysiin-lahaanshaha lagama soo dejisan karo adeegga cusboonaysiin ee Zinn® (%s). Isku day mar kale daqiiqado yar gudahood."

#: includes/class-updater.php:327
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "Cusboonaysiinta la soo dejiyay waxay ku guuldareysatay hubinta dhammaystirnaanteeda, lamana rakibin."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:85
msgid "Go Pro"
msgstr "U gudub Pro"

#: includes/class-upsell.php:112
msgid "A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands."
msgstr "Shaashadda falanqaynta kaydka ku-meel-gaarka ah: saamiga ku dhaca, xusuusta, furayaasha iyo amarrada kaydka ee ugu gaabis badan."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:113
msgid "A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible."
msgstr "Awoonee-weydiimaha gaabis ah iyo wicitaanada aan la kaydin ee magacaabaya qalabka ama mawduuca mas'uulka ka ah."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:114
msgid "An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer."
msgstr "Tier APCu ah oo xusuusta dhexdeeda ah oo ka horreeya Redis furayaasha ugu kulul, iyo sidoo kale prefetching, cadaadis (compression) iyo igbinary serializer."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:115
msgid "Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together."
msgstr "Nadiifinta sumaddan ku saleysan ee qoraallada, shuruudaha iyo alaabta WooCommerce, si kaliya waxa is beddelay loo tirtiro, iyadoo cache-ka bogga iyo walxaha la isla nadiifiyo."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:116
msgid "Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript."
msgstr "Diirinta keshiga otoomatiga ah ka dib nadiifinta, sawirada WebP iyo AVIF, ka saarida CSS-ka aan la isticmaalin iyo JavaScript-ka dib loo dhigay."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:117
msgid "Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules."
msgstr "Nadaqeynta keydka xogta ee la qorsheeyay oo wadata horudhac, iyo xeerarka kaydka ee bogagga ah."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:118
msgid "Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills."
msgstr "Digniinaha caafimaadka kaydka ku meelgaarka ah ee looxaaga Zinn Digital® marka heerka shaqadu hoos u dhaco ama xusuustu buuxsamto."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:132
msgid "Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:"
msgstr "Wax kasta oo ku jira tabisyada kale waa lacag la'aan oo sidaa bay ku ahaaneysaa. Pro wuxuu ku rakibayaa kor ku xusan plugin-kan wuxuuna ku darayaa:"

#: includes/class-upsell.php:134
msgid "See what Pro costs"
msgstr "Arag waxa uu Pro ku kacayo"

#. translators: 1: yearly price for one site, 2: for five sites, 3: for unlimited sites (each already formatted, e.g. $49).
#: includes/class-upsell.php:138
#, php-format
msgid "Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites."
msgstr "Qorshe kasta wuxuu ka bilaabmayaa 14 maalmood oo tijaabo ah oo lacag la'aan ah, kaarka deynta looma baahna: %1$s sannadkii hal degel, %2$s shan degel, %3$s degellada aan xadka lahayn."

#: includes/class-wp-config.php:66
msgid "wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( 'WP_CACHE', true ); to it."
msgstr "Lama helin wp-config.php, markaa WP_CACHE lama shidi karin. Ku dar define( 'WP_CACHE', true );."

